            <ArticleTitle>Henoch-Schönlein purpura: when and how to treat.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1661-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The many facets of Henoch-Schönlein purpura are described with emphasis on the gastrointestinal and renal manifestations. The controversy surrounding management of children with abdominal pain and nephritis is discussed with a review of the current literature to support recommendations for treatment options.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
